accessWidener	v2	official

# DisconnectedScreen keeps the disconnect reason in a private field with no getter, and the
# reason is the entire input to this mod's decision: whether a drop was a transport failure, a
# server restart or a moderator kick is only knowable from that Component.
#
# The alternative is a mixin, which this repo does not use anywhere (see ../CLAUDE.md). Opening
# one field to read is a far smaller commitment to Minecraft's internals than injecting into
# them, and it fails loudly at load time rather than silently at runtime if the field is ever
# renamed.
accessible	field	net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/DisconnectedScreen	details	Lnet/minecraft/network/DisconnectionDetails;
